stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NOT_CREATED
    NOT_CREATED --> CREATING: create_workspace()
    CREATING --> READY: Workspace & container initialized
    CREATING --> FAILED: Provisioning error

    READY --> INSTALLING_DEPENDENCIES: Phase A (Manifest detected)
    INSTALLING_DEPENDENCIES --> DEPENDENCIES_INSTALLED: pip / npm install complete
    INSTALLING_DEPENDENCIES --> FAILED: Dependency error / Timeout

    DEPENDENCIES_INSTALLED --> EXECUTING: Phase B (Offline tests)
    READY --> EXECUTING: Phase B (No new dependencies)

    EXECUTING --> COLLECTING_RESULTS: Process completed
    EXECUTING --> TIMED_OUT: Exceeded budget (kill process tree)
    EXECUTING --> CANCELLED: User requested cancellation

    COLLECTING_RESULTS --> COMPLETED: Exit code & diff captured
    COLLECTING_RESULTS --> FAILED: Execution error

    COMPLETED --> DESTROYED: Retention policy / destroy_workspace()
    FAILED --> DESTROYED: Error cleanup
    TIMED_OUT --> DESTROYED: Timeout cleanup
    CANCELLED --> DESTROYED: Cancellation cleanup
    DESTROYED --> [*]
